---
description: Rules for Next.js web apps
globs: apps/marketing/**,apps/invitation/**,apps/portal/**,apps/vendors/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- App Router, server components by default. Client components only where interactivity requires them.
- Tailwind v4 with the preset from `packages/config`; tokens and the brand shell from `packages/ui`. No hard-coded hex values. No shadcn/ui or Framer Motion; motion is CSS.
- Use logical properties only (`ms-`, `me-`, `ps-`, `pe-`, `start-`, `end-`, `text-start`). Never `ml-`, `mr-`, `left-`, `right-`.
- All copy goes through `packages/i18n`. Add the `en` keys.
- Never import `@managevent/db`. Data calls go server-side through `packages/api-client`; the browser reaches the API only through the app's same-origin `/api/auth` proxy.
- `invitation.` guest pages: no localStorage or sessionStorage, the core renders without JavaScript, `noindex` header and meta tag.
- Indexable pages: `www.` (except `/admin`), and only `/` and `/templates` on `invitation.`. Everything else is `noindex`.
